            <h3>Codeshare and Partnership Arrangements</h3>

            <p>Behind-the-scenes alliances multiply apparent options:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>British Airways and American coordinate through oneworld</li>
                <li>Delta and Virgin Atlantic/KLM/Air France align through various partnerships</li>
